    "diagnosis": "<p>Goblet cell carcinoma, high-grade pattern</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Medium-power view; in this example, the tumour is highly cellular, with streaming of tumour cells and loss of the discrete clustered units of low-grade goblet cell carcinoma. The grade of the tumour is determined by the percentage of tumour with high-grade growth.&nbsp;</p>",
